To measure from first (a whole number) with second (a whole number).
The dx is item first of xs minus item second of xs.
The dy is item first of ys minus item second of ys.
Set dist to dx times dx plus dy times dy.

To scan from anchor (a whole number) at other (a whole number) with marker (a whole number).
If marker is more than 2, return.
If marker is anchor, scan from anchor at other with marker plus 1, return.
If marker is other, scan from anchor at other with marker plus 1, return.
Measure from anchor with marker.
The d2 is dist.
If d2 is pairdistance, add 1 to matches.
Scan from anchor at other with marker plus 1.

To prepare from anchor (a whole number) with other (a whole number).
