If other is anchor, prepare from anchor with other plus 1, return.
Measure from anchor with other.
Set pairdistance to dist.
Set matches to 0.
Scan from anchor at other with 0.
Add matches to total.
Prepare from anchor with other plus 1.

For every anchor from 0 to 2.
